<h1>About CodeXpert</h1>
<p>CodeXpert is an online judge for practising competitive programming. It began as a Bulgarian high-school diploma project in 2025.</p>
<p>Browse competitions, open a problem and submit a solution in C++, Java, Python, JavaScript or C#. Judge0 evaluates your code against test cases with time and memory limits.</p>
<p>The leaderboard counts your best score for each problem. The daily challenge lets you improve a previously accepted solution for a bonus.</p>
<p>The interface and bundled problem statements are available in English. Original Bulgarian contest PDFs are also preserved for reference.</p>
